('ART10115','10','Art History','4','Study of art history, including foundational and intermediate concepts, practical applications, and analysis of relevant problems.','Undergraduate'),
('ART10116','10','Media Ethics','4','Study of media ethics, including foundational and intermediate concepts, practical applications, and analysis of relevant problems.','Undergraduate'),
